MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 RecurAccum_TestRecurAccum
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

RecurAccum_TestRecurAccum [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 5 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 Summer_SumUpTo
MOVE TEMP 6 4
L2	CJUMP LE TEMP 6 3 L3
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 5 TEMP 6 0 0
MOVE TEMP 6 PLUS TEMP 6 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 4
RETURN TEMP 5
END


MOVE TEMP 3 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 0
RETURN TEMP 9
END ( TEMP 7 5 0 )

PRINT TEMP 3

MOVE TEMP 3 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 0
RETURN TEMP 12
END ( TEMP 10 10 0 )

PRINT TEMP 3

RETURN 0
END

Summer_SumUpTo [ 3 ]
BEGIN
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 0 L5
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 0 L4
 
L4 
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 2

 JUMP L6
L5 
MOVE TEMP 3 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 0
RETURN TEMP 6
END ( TEMP 4 MINUS TEMP 1 1 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 1 )


L6 NOOP

RETURN TEMP 3
END

